Hi Dae,
I am attaching one patch which adds the support of rotation on top of Tomi'=
s DSS library.  But this patch is created against the patches posted by tom=
i long back.  You can have look at _dispc_calc_and_set_row_inc and _dispc_s=
et_rotation_mirroring function for reference to add the YUV support.  I hav=
e tested it with YUV, UYVY, RGB16 and RGB24u pixel format.  Currently it su=
pports pixel and row increment calculation only for rotation case.

Thanks and Regards,
Hardik Shah

